{"approved":false,"back_sample":{"translation":"The conversation ID runs within your browser and the multilingual Whisper Tiny model. During the first use, the browser downloads about 43 MB of open sample files from Hugging Face; the record itself is never sent there or to UsefulVerse. Your browser may store that sample for later, but may clear that cache. The sample is small, so assess names, numbers and fingerprints for errors. There is no server file-size or time limit; practical limits depend on your device, browser, memory, supported media codecs, battery and available storage.","truncated":false},"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"media-transcriber UI copy.body","detected_language":"sw","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"media-transcriber.copy.body","keys":["media-transcriber.copy.body"],"locale":"sw","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Utambulisho wa mazungumzo unaendeshwa ndani ya kivinjari chako na mfano wa lugha nyingi wa Whisper Tiny. Wakati wa matumizi ya kwanza, kivinjari kinapakua kuhusu ZXQPH0000QXZ MB ya faili za mfano wa wazi kutoka kwa Hugging Face; rekodi yenyewe haijawahi kutumwa huko au kwa ZXQPH0001QXZ. Kivinjari chako kinaweza kuhifadhi mfano huo kwa baadaye, lakini kinaweza kuondoa kwamba cache. Mfano ni mdogo, kwa hivyo tathmini majina, idadi na alama za vidole kwa makosa. Hakuna kikomo cha server cha faili-ukubwa au muda; mipaka ya vitendo inategemea kifaa chako, kivinjari, kumbukumbu, codecs za vyombo vya habari vinavyosaidiwa, betri na uhifadhi unaopatikana.","record_id":"e0ffa238660d7e3fec6559d47dfb38c9a17398fade62184b11a272a7d4b983b7","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40843674935","seconds":4.390529617124997,"source":"Speech recognition runs locally in your browser with the multilingual Whisper Tiny model. On first use, the browser downloads about 43 MB of open model files from Hugging Face; the recording itself is never sent there or to UsefulVerse. Your browser may cache the model for later, but can remove that cache. The model is compact, so review names, numbers and punctuation for mistakes. There is no fixed server file-size or duration quota; practical limits depend on your device, browser, memory, supported media codecs, battery and available storage. A desktop or laptop is strongly recommended for long or high-resolution recordings. Internet access is needed to download the model the first time.","source_commit":"e1f72394198c1a94fce448ea14cd79b496701273","source_hash":"9e065a681a1cc755ae72e5c69931709e5653a47d8bdbb807139c42c901b3d301","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Utambulisho wa mazungumzo unaendeshwa ndani ya kivinjari chako na mfano wa lugha nyingi wa Whisper Tiny. Wakati wa matumizi ya kwanza, kivinjari kinapakua kuhusu 43 MB ya faili za mfano wa wazi kutoka kwa Hugging Face; rekodi yenyewe haijawahi kutumwa huko au kwa UsefulVerse. Kivinjari chako kinaweza kuhifadhi mfano huo kwa baadaye, lakini kinaweza kuondoa kwamba cache. Mfano ni mdogo, kwa hivyo tathmini majina, idadi na alama za vidole kwa makosa. Hakuna kikomo cha server cha faili-ukubwa au muda; mipaka ya vitendo inategemea kifaa chako, kivinjari, kumbukumbu, codecs za vyombo vya habari vinavyosaidiwa, betri na uhifadhi unaopatikana.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
